{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日ブログ更新できなくて\nすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は内容も薄いし、\nおもしろくないし..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古頑張ってます！\nすごく楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n朝日新聞デジタル\n（乃木坂が聞く！）\n笹本玲奈さん、舞台で輝くためには？\n更新されたので、ぜひ見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笹本さん、本当に素敵な方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてもらったことを\n早速実践してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか自分の前髪短過ぎて\nびっくりしたよね。\nあれ、切りたてだったのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口ん中もう治ったのかい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前よかマシになりました！\nでも今度は唇の両方の端っこに\n口内炎みたいななんかすごいやつが\nできてしまったので、\n口を大きく開けると痛いんだな。\n...さっさと治します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今1番食べたいものはなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯と焼き魚と美味しい煮物と豚汁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにバレエ習ってたときは\nどのくらい体力あったのさ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいよ。もうね、やばいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントの名前をちょっと\n変えても誰かわかる？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとならわかる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レオタードってどんなの着てたー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無地の黒！\nスカートは邪魔臭いから無くて\n超シンプルでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"里芋煮とひじきって\nこれまた渋いな~ww\nまりっかは渋めの何かが好きなん??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋い...まあ渋いけど、\n好きなんですよね。\n渋いの基準てなんですかねえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GWどっかいくー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちにはそんな暇にゃないぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でブースに入った瞬間\n『あー！』って言われたら\n覚えてくれてるってことなのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれて嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーマン生で食べれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーマン大好きだけど\n生では食べないなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パプリカは生で食べたりするけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさんって、\n結構和風ですよねー。\n和食が好きですかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきでーーーーーーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのさ、コメントさ、毎回するのと\nたまにされるのとどっちがいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーコメントしたくなっちゃう\nブログ書けるようにがんばるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえばそいえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフィシャルウェブショップ\nメンバーデザインTシャツが\n限定販売されてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のデザインしたTシャツはこれだあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木。\nよく見たらとってもポップなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色はシンプルなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てて楽しいと思うー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/26/8833355/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックよろしくねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張るぞ！うおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}